page.upload_flow:
1. getDataRefreshUploadUrls (POST /api/scoped/data-refresh/upload-urls) — returns { uploadId, urls: Record[filename, presignedUrl] }
2. XMLHttpRequest PUT to each presigned S3 URL with progress tracking
3. triggerDataRefresh (POST /api/scoped/data-refresh/trigger, body: { uploadId }) — starts Step Functions execution, returns { executionId }
4. Poll getDataRefreshStatus every 3s until SUCCEEDED|FAILED|TIMED_OUT|ABORTED
5. 409 Conflict = pipeline already running — user-friendly toast with retry suggestion
